<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Thank
you for working hard to organize your upcoming blood drive.<b> </b>Your blood
drive plays an important role during this time to ensure there are no delays in
medical treatment for patients in need.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>When donors come to give blood </b><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Nov. 1 - Nov. 17, they'll get a $10 gift card* by email. Plus, they'll automatically be entered to win a $7,000 gift card.^^ There will be two lucky winners!</span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">As you continue the work to make your drive a success –
remember to use these tips:</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal"><b>Share the attached email</b>&nbsp;about these exciting incentives to recruit more blood donors!</li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Fill
     your schedule.</b> Use these tools to recruit blood donors and schedule
     them using the Blood Drive Management Portal.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Encourage
     donors to schedule a donation for a friend.</b> Each additional donor
     scheduled means more lives saved!<o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>IMPORTANT: Donors MUST have a valid email address on file
to receive their reward. <o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">All the best,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="noSpacingAbove spacingBelow" data-text-type="withSpacing" style="font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(50, 49, 48); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.6em; margin-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">*Presenting donors who receive this offer and present to donate during the applicable promotional time frame are eligible to receive the above described e-gift card(s). This offer is non-transferable and not redeemable for cash. Limit one (1) per presenting donor unless otherwise indicated. If a presenting donor qualifies for multiple offers, the donor will only receive the higher offer unless otherwise indicated. Instructions on how to redeem the gift card will be emailed to the address listed on the presenting donor’s American Red Cross donor profile approximately thirty (30) days after attempted donation(s). All gift cards are subject to individual merchant terms and conditions, and all trademarks are property of their respective owners. Merchants and offers are subject to change. No substitutions by presenting donors. American Red Cross is not responsible for lost, damaged, corrupted or stolen gift cards and may replace any such cards at its sole discretion. Any questions or problems in connection with redeeming gift cards must be directed to the merchant.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(50, 49, 48); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.4em; margin-left: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">^^NO PURCHASE OR DONATION NECESSARY. Void where prohibited and outside 50 US and DC. Open to legal residents of the 50 US/DC, age 18+ (19+ in NE and AL; 21+ in MS) at entry. Begins 12:00 AM ET on 11/01/2024; ends 11:59 PM ET on 11/17/2024. To enter, either present to donate blood at an American Red Cross blood donation facility or send an email to customercare@redcross.org and include the Giveaway name, "American Red Cross November $7K Prepaid Card Prize Giveaway.” Limit of three (3) total Entries permitted per Entrant, regardless of method of entry. Two (2) winners will each receive one (1) $7,000 Visa® Prepaid Card. Total ARV of all prizes: $14,000. Odds of winning depend on number of entries received. Full rules:</span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/local-homepage/events/thanks.html" style="color: rgb(164, 38, 44);"><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">&nbsp;click here</span></a><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">. Sponsor: American Red Cross.</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>